     "rawText": "A)\nDesign the circuit shown in figure for a voltage gain of 5 and a power budget of 6 mW. Assume the\nvoltage drop across RS is equal to the overdrive voltage of the transistor and RD = 200Ω. Assume\nµnCox = 200 µA/V2 ,λ=0, and VTH=0.4V.",
